      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Update: Frames only drop when Show Avatar is toggled.\nEX) When you block someone that you also have Show Avatar toggled on for, your FPS will drop.\nEX) When you've been blocked by someone who you have Show Avatar toggled on for, your FPS will drop.\nThis means blocking someone can affect both parties FPS if Show Avatar is used on the other involved. This explains why Quest was affected instead of PC due to Show Avatar being used more often.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
